<view class="page page-with-footer">

  <!-- 概览 -->
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">家里的库存</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">记下"我家现在有什么"，跟菜谱无关。菜单页会照着它标「食材都有 / 缺几样」。</view>
    <view class="hero-meta">
      <view class="hero-chip">共 {{stats.total}} 项</view>
      <view class="hero-chip">食材 {{stats.food}}</view>
      <view class="hero-chip">调料 {{stats.seasoning}}</view>
      <view class="hero-chip" wx:if="{{stats.other}}">其他 {{stats.other}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 添加 / 编辑 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>{{editing ? '修改「' + editing + '」' : '添加一样'}}</text>
      <text class="link" wx:if="{{editing}}" bindtap="onCancelEdit">取消</text>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">名称</view>
      <input
        class="input {{editing ? 'input-locked' : ''}}"
        value="{{form.name}}"
        disabled="{{!!editing}}"
        data-key="name"
        bindinput="onFormInput"
        placeholder="例如：生抽、五花肉、鸡蛋"
      />
      <view class="muted" wx:if="{{editing}}" style="margin-top:8rpx">名字就是它的身份，改名请删掉重新加一条。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="row-2">
      <view class="field picker-cell">
        <view class="field-label">分类</view>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{cats}}" value="{{catIndex}}" bindchange="onCatChange">
          <view class="picker">{{cats[catIndex]}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="field picker-cell">
        <view class="field-label">数量（可留空）</view>
        <input class="input" value="{{form.qty}}" data-key="qty" bindinput="onFormInput" placeholder="2 瓶 / 半袋" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">备注（可留空）</view>
      <input class="input" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="onFormInput" placeholder="放在灶台下柜子里" />
    </view>

    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onAdd">{{editing ? '保存修改' : '加进库存'}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 从菜谱食材快速添加 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title" bindtap="onToggleQuick">
      <text>从菜谱食材快速点选</text>
      <text class="link">{{showQuick ? '收起' : '展开'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">
      菜谱里一共出现过 {{ingredientCount}} 种食材，点一下就是"家里有"。还有 {{quickMissing}} 种没点。
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{showQuick}}">
      <input class="input chip-filter" value="{{chipFilter}}" bindinput="onChipFilter" placeholder="搜一下，比如「酱」" />

      <view class="chips">
        <view
          class="chip {{item.have ? 'chip-on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{quickChips}}"
          wx:key="name"
          data-name="{{item.name}}"
          data-have="{{item.have}}"
          bindtap="onToggleChip"
        >{{item.have ? '✓ ' : '+ '}}{{item.name}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!quickChips.length}}">
        <view>没找到匹配的食材</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <!-- 批量粘贴 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title" bindtap="onToggleBulk">
      <text>批量粘贴</text>
      <text class="link">{{showBulk ? '收起' : '展开'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">一行一样，可以带数量：生抽 2瓶 / 五花肉 1斤 / 小葱</view>

    <block wx:if="{{showBulk}}">
      <textarea
        class="bulk-input"
        value="{{bulkText}}"
        bindinput="onBulkInput"
        placeholder="生抽 2瓶&#10;老抽 1瓶&#10;五花肉 1斤"
        maxlength="2000"
      />
      <view class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top:18rpx" bindtap="onBulkAdd">识别并加入</view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <!-- 库存清单 -->
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="cat">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>{{item.cat}}（{{item.count}}）</text>
    </view>

    <view
      class="prow"
      wx:for="{{item.items}}"
      wx:for-item="it"
      wx:key="name"
      data-name="{{it.name}}"
      bindtap="onPickItem"
    >
      <view class="prow-main">
        <view class="prow-name">{{it.name}}</view>
        <view class="prow-note" wx:if="{{it.note}}">{{it.note}}</view>
      </view>
      <text class="prow-qty" wx:if="{{it.qty}}">{{it.qty}}</text>
      <view class="prow-del" catchtap="onRemove" data-name="{{it.name}}">✕</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{!loading && !stats.total}}">
    <view class="empty">
      <text class="empty-emoji">🧺</text>
      <view>库存还是空的</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-top:12rpx">上面「从菜谱食材快速点选」点几下就能建起来，不用一个个打字。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{stats.total}}">
    <view class="card-title">维护</view>
    <view class="muted">换了住处、大扫除之后可以整体清空重来。</view>
    <view class="actions" style="margin-top:20rpx">
      <view class="btn" bindtap="onRefresh">刷新</view>
      <view class="btn btn-danger" bindtap="onClearAll">清空库存</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>
</view>
